sequenceDiagram
    participant Req as Requester<br/>(jms-request-reply-requester)
    participant RQ as CAMEL.REQUEST.QUEUE
    participant Resp as Responder<br/>(jms-request-reply-responder)
    participant RepQ as CAMEL.REPLY.QUEUE.{instanceId}

    Note over Req: Generate UUID correlationId<br/>Set X-Reply-Queue: CAMEL.REPLY.QUEUE.{id}

    Req->>RQ: send(request XML)<br/>JMSCorrelationID: uuid<br/>X-Reply-Queue: CAMEL.REPLY.QUEUE.{id}
    Req->>Req: pendingRequests.put(correlationId)

    RQ->>Resp: deliver request
    Note over Resp: Extract correlationId<br/>Extract X-Reply-Queue header<br/>Process order → APPROVED

    Resp->>RepQ: send(response XML)<br/>JMSCorrelationID: same uuid

    RepQ->>Req: deliver reply
    Note over Req: pendingRequests.remove(correlationId)<br/>→ non-null: VALID ✓<br/>→ null: REJECTED ✗
